No speech model is included or downloaded by these packages.
The release sources are unmodified. Translation catalogues are not yet shipped
upstream. Captions remain opt-in; service and socket activation are not enabled
by installation.

The Debian snapshot has webrtc-audio-processing-1, not the upstream optional
webrtc-audio-processing-2 dependency. The upstream default consequently builds
without microphone echo cancellation. Separate streams remain supported, but
a microphone can hear and caption the loudspeakers again.

Model suites and daemon/transcribe suites that call the Whisper loader are
excluded on the packaging station. Model-free suites are run in isolation.
